# Procedur control file
# Comments:
# Any line that starts with a # is a comment line
#               08-Jun-2000/SS: Script IGSF_S7D added
#               05-Sep-2000/SS: Script IGSF_D7D added
#               12-Jul-2001/SS: Script POLXTR_F added
#               30-Aug-2001/RD: Script ADDNEQ2 -> ADDNQ2_7
#                               (the new menu is not able to perform a 7 week solution)
#                               If the new menu is able to handle this, this change may
#                               be removed...
#               13-Sep-2001/SS: Follow a two-step procedure to generate SINEX file
#               14-Sep-2001/SS: Script SNX_COP added
#               17-Sep-2001/MM: Script HELMER added
#               29-Sep-2001/SS: Monitor weekly geocenter coordinates (GCC)
#               11-Oct-2001/SS: Compute and compare free solution
#               17-Oct-2001/HU: POLXTR_F activated
#               17-Dec-2001/SS: Generate F7 NQ0 (with HR EOPs) and F7N NQ0 (with daily ERPs,
#                               but without nutation, geocenter, and satellite antenna offset  
#                               parameters)                                                    
#               06-Mar-2002/SS: V_CAMP added
#               16-Mar-2002/SS: EXPRESS introduced
#               11-Jul-2002/SS: Create weekly STA SUM file as part of F7 GCC computation
#               02-Aug-2002/SS: Perform HELMER in order to check all a priori coordinates;
#                               compute updated coordinates wrt epoch 2000.0
#               03-Apr-2003/ss: FIX_CHK implemented
#               31-Aug-2004/rd: Adapt to the new CPU file
#               30-Nov-2004/ss: Make use of STA2STA
#               09-Dec-2004/ss: Velocity estimation (for AMUN)
#               04-Apr-2005/ss: BPE_BYE as last process added
#               24-Apr-2007/ss: Second call of STA2STA
#               03-Aug-2007/mm: V_UPD, V_SAV, V_DEL, V_DIS introduced
#               06-Nov-2007/rd: Update a priori coordinate file ($xr/${V_CRDINF}upd.CRD)
#               24-Jul-2008/rd,ps: V_SATCRX for satellite problem file, prepared for repro
#               25-Jul-2008/ps: Removed SNX_COP
#               08-Jan-2009/rd,ps: V_STAINF for satellite problem file
#               26-Mar-2009/dt: Set CPU to BIG for all ADDNEQ2
#               27-Jan-2011/ss: IGSF_TRA sequence added
#               21-Apr-2011/ss: Switch from IGS05 to IGS08
#               07-Feb-2012/ps: added V_REPERP, V_REPSNX, V_REP7D
#               26-Sep-2012/ss: Renamed FIX_CHK to FIX_CHK7
#               02-Oct-2012/ss: Completely redesigned
#               18-Oct-2012/ss: Switch from IGS08 to IGb08
#               19-Oct-2012/ss: Additional solutions (e.g. H71, H73)
#               24-Oct-2012/ss: SNX_LOOP added
#               20-Jun-2013 SL: S7D and D7D reactivated
#               28-Jun-2013 SL: IEPMERGE added
#               18-Jul-2013/rd,hb: V_SATINF: SAT_1452->SAT_NONE
#               18-Jul-2013/rd,lp: V_OBSSEL added
#               13-Sep-2013/rd: WEEKPRE and CLK_WAIT added
#               21-Sep-2016/av: V_PSDINF introduced
#               02-Feb-2017 AV/RD: Switch to IGS14
#               04-Dec-2017 AV: V_MACMOD and V_BOXWNG introduced
#               22-Feb-2018 SS: Merged F3M IEP files (for verification purposes)
#               29-Mar-2018 ss/rd: Added WEEKPRE for SP3d
#               02-May-2018 ss: Added COOVEL for day -3 (mid of week)
#               21-Aug-2019 RD: Add V_BLQINF, V_SUBMOD, V_NUTMOD
#               07-Feb-2020 RD: Switch from FES2004 to FES2014b
#               16-Apr-2020 RD: V_SP3INT added (sampling in STDPRE)
#               22-May-2020 MK: Switched to IGb14
#               09-Jul-2020 RD/AV: Remove the one-day solution steps
#               05-May-2021 AV: Change from Compatibility to Macromodel
#               01-Sep-2021 RD: Transform into the new PCF format
#               01-Sep-2021 RD/ST/LP: Reorder BPE server variables for reporting
#               08-Sep-2021 LP: Add V_GNSS: GNSS to be processed (for WEEKSUM/SATWEEK)
#               28-Nov-2021 LP: Remove V_MACMOD
#               28-Mar-2022 ST: Rename V_CAMP to V_REQ_CAMP.
#               29-Mar-2022 AV: Modified keywords
#               17-Nov-2022 SS: Changed V_SP3INT from 900 to 300
#               30-Nov-2022 SS: Changed V_T from F3P_ to F3U_
#               02-Dec-2022 AV: Switch from IGb14 to IGS20
#               06-Dec-2022 LP: Switch from BOXWING.MAC to BOXWING_I20.MAC
#               11-May-2023 LP: Add V_GRAVMOD
#               21-Sep-2023 SS: Updated V_GRAVMOD to COSTG_FSM_2303
#               18-Oct-2023 SS: Moved CRD_UPD process to PPPFINAL
#               22-Dec-2023 RD: Update V_DOI
#               12-Jan-2024 LP: Updated V_GRAVMOD to COSTG_FSM_2309
#               03-Sep-2024 SS: Updated V_GRAVMOD to COSTG_FSM_2312
#               22-Oct-2024 MK: Updated V_GRAVMOD to COSTG_FSM_2406
#               02-Feb-2025 EB: Change from IGS20 to IGB20
#               03-Sep-2025 SS: Updated V_GRAVMOD to COSTG_FSM_2412
#               14-Jan-2026 SS: Updated V_GRAVMOD to COSTG_FSM_2503
#               15-Jan-2026 EB/SS: Changed from IGB20 to IGC20 and from I20_2388 to I20_2401=I20
#               28-Jan-2026 SS: Added BPE_INI with V_INI=Y
#               13-Feb-2026 SS: Changed from from I20_2401 to I20_2405=I20
#               26-Feb-2026 EB: Updated V_GRAVMOD to COSTG_FSM_2509
#               19-May-2026 RD: Update V_DOI
#               09-Jul-2026 SS: Updated V_GRAVMOD to COSTG_FSM_2603
#
# ============================================================================

PID  SCRIPT    OPT_DIR   PARAMETERS
000  BPE_INI   NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; SCR_PATH=${AIUB}/BPE_SCR
#
# Copy data and prepair input files
# ---------------------------------
001  GOTO_REP  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=000; NEXTJOB=_ 100
002  REPF_C7D  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=001
004  ORB_VER7  IGSF_V3P  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=002; CONT_ERR; PARAM2=V_N
#
099  GOTO_REP  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=004; NEXTJOB=101
100  IGSF_C7D  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=099
101  STA2STA   NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=100; PARAM1=C03_CRX
102  STA2STA   NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=100; PARAM1=IGS_SNX; PARAM2=RNX_CRX
111  INIT_FIX  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=100; PARAM1=C; PARAM4=WEEK
112  INIT_FIX  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=100; PARAM1=G; PARAM4=WEEK
121  COOVEL    IGSF_F7M  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=100
199  DUMMY     NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=101 102 111 112 121
#
# Generate weekly solution based on 3-day NEQs
# --------------------------------------------
300  ADDNEQ2   IGSF_F73  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=199
301  DUMMY     IGSF_F73  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=300
302  FIX_CHK   IGSF_F73  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=301; NEXTJOB=300
310  ADDNEQ2   IGSF_N73  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=302
311  ADDNEQ2   IGSF_S73  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=310
312  ADDNEQ2   IGSF_G73  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=310
313  SNX_LOOP  IGSF_L73  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=311; PARAM1=G; PARAM3=WEEK
319  GOTO_REP  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=310; NEXTJOB=800
320  ADDNEQ2   IGSF_H73  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=319
321  ADDNEQ2   IGSF_T73  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=319
322  HELMER    IGSF_T73  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=321
323  MAKE_TRA  IGSF_T73  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=322; PARAM1=T73; PARAM2=T73
#
# Generating summary files
# ------------------------
800  DUMMY     NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=311 312 313 320 323
801  ORB_LST   NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=800
802  WEEKFIT   IGSF_WKS  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=801; CONT_ERR
810  CLK_WAIT  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=802
# Clean from cof (WKd is SP3d test, can be deleted as well)
811  WEEKSUM   IGSF_WKS  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=810; PARAM1=STOP
812  WEEKPRE   IGSF_WK3  CPU=SHORT; WAIT=811
822  POLXTR    IGSF_F73  CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=811
829  IEPMERGE  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=822; PARAM1=-6
#
# Finish the story (operational)
# ------------------------------
900  GOTO_REP  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=812 829; NEXTJOB=950
901  IGSF_S7D  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=900
902  IGSF_D7D  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=901
#
# Finish the story (reprocessing)
# -------------------------------
950  GOTO_REP  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=902; NEXTJOB=_ 999
951  BPE_LOG   NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=950
952  REPF_S7D  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=951
953  IGSF_D7D  NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=952; SKIP
#
999  BPE_BYE   NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=812 953; PARAM1=168

VARIABLE     DEFAULT        PARAMETERS
V_DOI      = 10.48620/97773; DESCRIPTION=Product DOI
#
# Solution IDs used in the BPE:
# ----------------------------
V_F        = F3N;           DESCRIPTION=
V_G        = F73;           DESCRIPTION=
V_H        = S73;           DESCRIPTION=
V_I        = F7_;           DESCRIPTION=
V_K        = F7N;           DESCRIPTION=
V_N        = F3_;           DESCRIPTION=
V_P        = H73;           DESCRIPTION=
V_R        = T73;           DESCRIPTION=
V_FIX      = F7;            DESCRIPTION=Identifier for datum definition check
V_T        = F3U_;          DESCRIPTION=
V_X        = W7_;           DESCRIPTION=7-week check
V_Z        = TMP;           DESCRIPTION=Temporary results
#
# Reference frame and station related files:
# -----------------------------------------
V_CRDINF   = IGC20;         DESCRIPTION=CRD/VEL/FIX master file name
V_PSDINF   = IGC20;         DESCRIPTION=PSD corrections
#
V_STAINF   = CODE;          DESCRIPTION=Station information file
V_STACRX   = IGS_CRX;       DESCRIPTION=Station problem file
#
# General and model files:
# -----------------------
V_OBSSEL   = OBSERV_COD;    DESCRIPTION=Observation selection file
V_SATINF   = SATELLIT;      DESCRIPTION=Satellite information file
V_PCVINF   = ANT_COD;       DESCRIPTION=PCV information file
V_PCV      = I20_2444;      DESCRIPTION=GNSS PCV model
#
V_SATCRX   = SAT;           DESCRIPTION=Satellite problem file
V_SYSCRX   = SAT_GNSS;      DESCRIPTION=Satellite problem file for data import
#
V_MEANPL   = IERS2010_v1.2.0; DESCRIPTION=Mean pole model
V_SUBMOD   = DESAI2016;       DESCRIPTION=Subdaily pole model
V_NUTMOD   = IAU2000R06;      DESCRIPTION=Nutation model
V_GRAVMOD  = COSTG_FSM_2603; DESCRIPTION=Gravity field model
#
V_BLQINF   = FES2014b;      DESCRIPTION=BLQ file name, CMC corrections
#
# Processing options used in the BPE:
# ----------------------------------
V_PRECLK   = EST;           DESCRIPTION=Clocks for the precise file (BRD/EST)
#
V_GNSS     = GRE;           DESCRIPTION=GNSS selection (RINEX system char.)
#
V_BOXWNG   = BOXWING_I20;   DESCRIPTION=Boxwing model file
V_SP3INT   = 300;           DESCRIPTION=Sampling in archived precise files
#
V_REQ_CAMP = IGSFINAL;      DESCRIPTION=Campaign to be used
V_RERUN    = 1;             DESCRIPTION=Number of reruns in case of failure
V_PLUS     = +0;            DESCRIPTION=Plus  days
V_MINUS    = -6;            DESCRIPTION=Minus days
#
V_SNXINF   = SINEX_IGS;     DESCRIPTION=SINEX information skeleton
#
# Variables related to reprocessing:
# ---------------------------------
V_REPERP   = C04_$Y+0;      DESCRIPTION=A priori pole file for reprocessing
V_REPSNX   = C1A_SNX;       DESCRIPTION=Station exclusion weekly SINEX for reprocessing
V_REP7D    = C1A_7D;        DESCRIPTION=Station exclusion weekly solution for reprocessing
V_PRC      = F7_;           DESCRIPTION=Summary of BPE log files
#
# Other variables:
# ---------------
V_INI      = Y;             DESCRIPTION=BPE initalization mode (Y/N/Verified)
V_XTR      = Y;             DESCRIPTION=Automatic program extraction (GPSXTR)
V_UPD      = Y;             DESCRIPTION=Update general files?
V_SAV      = Y;             DESCRIPTION=Save results?
V_DEL      = Y;             DESCRIPTION=Delete results?
V_DIS      = N;             DESCRIPTION=Distribute results?
